<note style="-uslm-lc:I74" topic="amendments" id="id0bd058ba-810c-11f1-b7ce-bdea3d14cbdd"><heading class="centered smallCaps">Amendments</heading><p style="-uslm-lc:I21" class="indent0">1972—<ref href="/us/pl/92/272">Pub. L. 92–272</ref> substituted “$42,500” for “$20,000”.</p>
